# FantasyPros

> FantasyPros aggregates rankings, projections, advice, and tools from 100+ fantasy sports experts to help users win their leagues across NFL, MLB, NBA, NHL, and daily fantasy sports.

FantasyPros combines expert consensus rankings (ECR) with personalized advice and league-syncing tools. Users can connect leagues from ESPN, Yahoo, Sleeper, CBS, and other platforms to get tailored start/sit recommendations, trade analysis, waiver pickups, and draft assistance. Premium tiers (PRO, MVP, HOF) unlock advanced tools, while a large portion of content is free.

